WEBVTT

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:05.140
<i>Last night, Wild Calling won</i>
<i>their game six to two.</i>

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.020
<i>The losing team, Night Runners,</i>
<i>had three deaths.</i>

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:12.070
<i>With the death of the last dodo beastman</i>
<i>in a double play during the game,</i>

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.740
<i>dodo beastmen have gone extinct.</i>

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.400
<i>In other news...</i>

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.450
Aren't you turning back
to your human form?

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:28.250
Well, yes, but being in human form
is like wearing high heels all the time.

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.290
-Do you know what I mean?
-Not in the least.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.880
Basically, this is way more comfortable.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.010
Being a tanuki
is more comfortable, you say?

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.300
-Melissa!
-Yes?

00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:44.350
Isn't there a basketball club
or a basketball association in this town?

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:45.520
Basketball?

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.440
I want to play in a game so bad!

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:50.440
I haven't played in so long,
I feel like I'm getting stiff.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.150
A game? We've got those.

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.110
What? You do?

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.620
Look! A game.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:04.290
This is baseball. This isn't basketball.

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:09.920
They run around chasing the ball,
so it's not really any different.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.300
Hello to the five or six
baseball fans in Anima-City.

00:02:14.380 --> 00:02:17.010
Pink Flamingos,
as you can see, are all hotties!

00:02:17.090 --> 00:02:19.800
Their opponent, Bears,
as you can see, are lamebrain bears.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.640
They're on a fantastic
record-breaking losing streak!

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.810
They're all playing baseball as beastmen.

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:29.600
Hey!

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.480
Hey!

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.440
Hey!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.320
Okay!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:56.460
A miracle pitch!

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.090
In the bottom half,
the pink babes have taken the field.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:02.720
He's hit the ball!

00:03:08.020 --> 00:03:09.100
Out!

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:12.150
You've got to be kidding!

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:16.270
Hey! That chick took something out of
her wing and threw them at that guy!

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.360
What?

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.280
-What about it?
-Who do you think you are?

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.780
There's always some ugly prig
prattling about right and wrong!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:24.240
What a priggish mouth!

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.450
What?

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.500
Well, if it isn't Ms. Tanuki.
Fancy meeting you here.

00:03:29.830 --> 00:03:33.630
I'm a mink! I'm not a weasel.
I'm Marie the mink.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:35.210
I haven't said anything.

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.210
-So who are you betting on?
-Bet?

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:41.550
As usual, you don't have a clue.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:44.970
Baseball in Anima-City
is a total gambling deathmatch.

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.140
What?

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.970
It's beastman nature to want to win
even if you have to kill.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:53.440
The flashier the kills, the happier
the fans are. That's what they bet on.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:59.730
Win or lose. Live or die.
That's Anima-City baseball.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:00.860
You must be kidding.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.860
Okay! The babes are up to bat.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.820
With her flamingo swing,
she hits the ball!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.450
It happens to...

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.750
smash the pitcher!

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:13.830
It hammered Bears' pitcher, Winnie Poo.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.920
Poo's getting carried off on a stretcher.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.880
Oh, dear.
Without a pitcher, you're done for.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:21.300
There are only nine members on their team.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.670
It looks like we won.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.220
Coach.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:26.510
Coach.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.680
Coach!

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.890
That's a hole in one!

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:36.350
That girl is our new pitcher.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:37.810
What? Me?

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.530
-No way! Impossible!
-You'll be fine. Just fine.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.400
Back her up, guys!

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.740
Okay!

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:45.950
Bears have a new pitcher.

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.120
She's clearly an amateur tanuki girl
they've forced onto the field.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.410
-What do they want me to do?
-They're clearly shorthanded.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:55.290
Hey, ugly! I'm talking to you, ugly!
Hurry it up, ugly!

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.920
You're ugly and you are a tanuki.
That's so pitiful, I want to cry.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.630
But I've got a nail appointment later,
so I've got no time for sympathy!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:07.300
If you're not going to pitch,
then go back home and build a mud boat!

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.680
You're the ones who are so disgusting
that it looks pitiful.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:12.770
What?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:17.400
How dare you mock the way people look
because they're born that way?

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:22.440
Moreover, you pigeonhole them
to make yourselves feel superior!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.200
That's a sexy strike!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:32.290
You've got to be kidding me!

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:36.580
That's an unbelievably brilliant
miracle pitch!

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:38.040
No way!

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.470
It's the bottom of the ninth.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.930
With the bases loaded,
Bears have a chance to win this!

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.390
The batter is the tanuki
miracle-pitch girl!

00:05:56.810 --> 00:06:01.610
I've got to build a mud boat later,
so can you hurry this up?

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.570
Why, you!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.280
She's hit it!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:11.990
It's gone!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:14.700
It's out of the park! I'm dumbfounded!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.410
It's a come-from-behind win for Bears!

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:24.130
-Ogami, have you ever played baseball?
-No.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.220
-How about baseball betting?
-What?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.050
I want some proof of baseball betting.
It's rampant in this city.

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:35.310
Everyone knows that Flip of the Family
controls all the gambling here.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.430
It won't be easy.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.810
In a baseball game yesterday,
dodo beastmen went extinct.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:48.030
I wonder what species of beastmen
will go extinct in baseball next.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:52.280
<i>We've got no money</i>

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.700
<i>And we've got no dreams either</i>

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:59.290
<i>But we've got</i>

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.290
<i>Double the hunger of anyone</i>

00:07:04.170 --> 00:07:06.710
It's not big, but come on in.

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.010
You're right. It really is tiny.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:14.640
Our water supply has been cut,
so I got water from the park.

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:16.140
Here.

00:07:16.220 --> 00:07:18.270
We've got a favor to ask you, Michiru.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.940
Won't you please become Bears' pitcher?

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:23.650
Please?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.230
-Please?
-Please?

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:29.190
-Hold on a second!
-Please!

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:30.610
Look! I'm not a bear!

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:33.200
Being a raccoon is good enough.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:35.830
We bears don't discriminate.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:39.200
I was so happy when we won today.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.790
We've only ever won by default.

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:45.290
With you on our team, Michiru,
we could be champions.

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:46.420
Champions!

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.840
-You know, I really can't play baseball.
-Champions!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:49.960
-I'm sorry.
-Champions!

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:50.920
What?

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.680
I'm really very sorry.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.180
Such a short-lived dream.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.060
We can't play ball without a pitcher.

00:08:04.520 --> 00:08:06.520
All we've got is baseball.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:11.320
Anyone born here has to live
their whole life drinking muddy water.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:15.530
Okay, fine! I'll play!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.240
Yes!

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:19.950
But don't kill anyone!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.500
What? Why?

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.870
I will play baseball,
but I'm not going to kill!

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.840
-We won't kill, but what about injure?
-No!

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:29.710
-Sprained fingers?
-No!

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.010
-Broken nails?
-Hangnails too?

00:08:32.090 --> 00:08:34.970
When I say no, it means no!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:39.810
Hello to all you hard-up
Anima-City slackers.

00:08:39.890 --> 00:08:41.310
Today's baseball game is between

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:44.890
the ragtag, lamebrain Bears
who used a lifetime of luck

00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:46.560
in their comeback win last game,

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:50.780
and the heavyweight stars of
the betting baseball world, the Buffalos.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.980
Let's play ball!

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:54.990
It's the dirt-poor lamebrain Bears at-bat!

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.410
It's an unexpectedly slow pitch.

00:08:58.490 --> 00:09:02.120
He hit it!
He toils down the line to first! Safe!

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:05.790
Bears' coach
is making an easy-to-read bunt sign.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:06.870
They can read your sign!

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.340
The Buffalos infielders
have closed in fast.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:11.090
They actually bunted.

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:12.420
That was an easy out!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.380
Bears' coach is signaling
a bunt again. Seriously?1

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.090
Or is it a clever trick?

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:19.430
It's a bunt!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:23.140
Out! They're so dumb,
their honey could outsmart them!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:26.640
The idiot Bears cleanup batter
is their famous tanuki girl.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.850
Bears' coach's sign is totally obvious.

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.070
Such rare honesty!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.950
The tanuki woman gives it
her gorilla swing!

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.870
The fighting bulls race after
the fly ball!

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.330
The tanuki-gorilla girl's really flying!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:48.920
She's got the feet of a cheetah!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.460
The beef boys toss it home!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:56.670
Who's faster, the ball or the cheetah?
The cheetah or the ball?

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:00.260
Safe!

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:04.060
Incredibly, the ragged,
hard-up, lamebrain Bears won!

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:07.810
Like tossing pearls to swine,
it was a victory that did nobody any good.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:11.610
You were supposed to lose, right?

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.860
Here is today's take.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:25.410
Who the heck would bet on a team
of weak players and fighters like Bears?

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.660
If baseball loses popularity,

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:31.330
my profits will go down.
We don't want that, right?

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:34.550
Next time, I swear we'll lose!

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:36.920
Next time, you'll sleep with the fish!

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.760
What were you doing in that shop?

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.730
I was eating pizza, obviously.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.060
I'm looking for proof of baseball betting.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:51.150
Will you testify?

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:54.440
Nobody gets to live
after defying the Family.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:57.740
Hang with them,
and they'll just exploit you, you know.

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:03.450
For us beastmen, this is our only choice
if we want to make a living off baseball.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.420
-You're playing right field today.
-What?

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:13.170
And you're pitching.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.460
What? Me?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:18.050
Coach! Michiru is our ace pitcher!
Michiru should pitch!

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:19.010
That's right!

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:23.970
Silence! I'm the coach here!
Just do as I tell you!

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:27.470
I can't possibly pitch.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.600
Don't worry. We'll back you up.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.850
Win this,
and we'll make it to the finals.

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:33.770
-You want to be champions, right?
-Yes!

00:11:33.850 --> 00:11:36.190
-Let's win this together!
-Yes!

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:44.990
FIRST BEASTMAN BASEBALL PLAYER

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.160
<i>This is your new teammate, Dante.</i>

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.500
<i>The first beastman ballplayer.</i>

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:53.250
<i>Beastmen are not allowed in this hotel.</i>

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:56.590
<i>Keep the animals in the zoo!</i>

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.710
<i>Animals can do it outside.</i>

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.670
<i>Animals don't need a bench to sit on.</i>

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.010
You dumb animal.

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:07.760
Fuck off and die, you stupid animal.

00:12:28.990 --> 00:12:31.830
Today's pitcher for Bears is Rascal Arai.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.080
Her glove's an oven mitt.
I doubt they'll win.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.290
And she's facing...

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.550
the swaggering Tigers!

00:12:43.590 --> 00:12:48.010
Deep fly ball! Nobody's gone after it!
They'll never make it!

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:52.850
There she goes! The tenacious tanuki girl
is making a cheetah dash!

00:12:52.930 --> 00:12:57.650
Making use of her animal instinct to chase
anything that moves, she leaps!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:01.030
Oh, dear! She's not going to reach it!

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.400
-No way!
-That idiot!

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:08.120
That gives Bears the win!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.700
A hundred yen on this long shot
would get you 10,000!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:13.580
Their popularity has skyrocketed as well!

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:15.660
Next, it's the championship game!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:23.760
Hey, gorilla tanuki. Didn't you promise
not to use your power in public?

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.800
Don't get carried away.
What if people find out?

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.470
I know, but...

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.300
If your power is exposed,

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:33.770
you'll be kicked out of this town
even before you're cured.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:38.650
Bears are so dumb, it's pitiful.
But they love baseball so much.

00:13:38.730 --> 00:13:40.480
I have never met beastmen
like that before.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.490
When I play baseball with them,
I forget about my beastman disease.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.280
You want to forget?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:48.450
No, I don't.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.780
But for the first time
since I came here...

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:54.500
In fact, since I got beastman disease,

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.160
I feel happy.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:04.170
Help me!

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:08.550
Good news. Bears are getting more popular.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:10.890
The more pitiful they are,
the more adorable they become.

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:14.640
If you lose the next game,
I'll forget everything that's happened.

00:14:15.310 --> 00:14:19.190
Defy me, and you'll be fish food.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.120
Damn it.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:37.290
Where did I go wrong
to deserve a life like this?

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:41.000
If I'm going to die anyway, then...

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.000
<i>Hello, all you gambling addicts!</i>

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:45.710
<i>The big day is finally here!</i>

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.800
<i>It's the championship game</i>
<i>of the Anima-City baseball league!</i>

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:52.140
<i>It's the former lamebrain,</i>
<i>current slum stars, Bears </i>

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:56.810
<i>versus Killer Animals,</i>
<i>a group of noxious, murderous beasts!</i>

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:58.680
If you don't want to die,

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:02.310
why don't you go home
and suck on honey, you teddy bears?

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.440
Play ball!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:07.280
<i>The tanuki girl is full of enthusiasm!</i>

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:10.990
<i>The rabid dog has a cracked bat.</i>
<i>It's a super bat!</i>

00:15:11.070 --> 00:15:13.280
<i>Don't worry, just throw the ball,</i>
<i>tanuki girl.</i>

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:18.080
<i>There it is! The shotgun swing!</i>

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.630
What?

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.090
<i>It's one rough play after another!</i>

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.340
<i>Those are real animal killers for you!</i>

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:41.390
<i>Bears aren't putting up a fight at all.</i>
<i>What a magnificent, apathetic play!</i>

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.020
Coach! He's not here!

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.730
What happened to all of you?

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:47.690
Nothing.

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.650
You're hiding something from me!

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:57.530
It's not like we're hiding
that we'll get paid even if we lose.

00:15:57.620 --> 00:15:58.490
You moron!

00:15:58.580 --> 00:16:00.200
What's that all about?

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:04.710
<i>If you lose to Killer Animals,</i>
<i>I'll give you this.</i>

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.340
What? The game is fixed?

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:12.970
I don't know if we can win,
but it's really easy to lose.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.430
Wasn't it your dream to be champions?

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:20.060
Dazzled by money,
you toss aside your dreams so easily?

00:16:20.140 --> 00:16:21.520
How stupid can you be?

00:16:21.930 --> 00:16:23.190
Yes! We're stupid!

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:27.270
We were all born poor,
and we'll always be poor!

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:31.740
What's wrong with taking money
that'll take us out of this hellhole?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.090
Saotome speaking.

00:16:53.170 --> 00:16:56.550
What?
The money's been stolen from the safe?

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.180
What kind of moron are you?

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:02.060
All the money from the bets was in there,
you stupid idiot!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:04.060
All the betting money was stolen?

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:05.770
Where's the money I bet?

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:07.190
Give me back my money!

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.400
Who the hell watches baseball
if you can't bet on it?

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.190
<i>What in the world is going on?</i>
<i>The stadium is in an uproar!</i>

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:14.990
<i>The game is being postponed.</i>

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:30.920
The game isn't over yet!

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.090
Are you going to run
with your tail between your legs?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:39.550
Are you that afraid of losing?

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:43.100
What are you so scared of?

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:49.100
Isn't baseball in this town
about winning or losing, living or dying?

00:17:49.650 --> 00:17:54.570
Then get out here and play with pride
like your life depends on it!

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:03.490
<i>With one mighty swing</i>

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:07.660
<i>We'll come from behind and win</i>

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:11.040
<i>We are Bears</i>

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:14.710
<i>The hope of all bears</i>

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.630
Back her up, guys!

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.090
Yes!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.350
You sure got balls, little girl tanuki.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.230
If you try and hit me with a pitch here,

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:29.230
I'll sue you so bad, you'll disappear
off the face of the earth!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:33.440
You'd better believe it.
We're not here to kill you.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.190
We're here to play baseball!

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:38.700
<i>What an amazing development!</i>
<i>The game has re-started!</i>

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:43.580
You again?

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.990
Please! Forget you saw me!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.790
<i>What a hit! Will it go out?</i>

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:51.380
<i>It's gone! Home run!</i>

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:53.670
<i>Bears have closed the gap to one run!</i>

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:13.730
<i>Incredible! Can they come back and win?</i>

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:16.940
<i>This has become an unprecedented,</i>
<i>historic game in Anima-City baseball!</i>

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:20.570
<i>Slackers from around the city have</i>
<i>packed the stadium to see live baseball!</i>

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:24.120
<i>Killer Animals have a one run-lead!</i>

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:28.080
What? Coach?
Where the heck have you been?

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:29.750
Another sign?

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.290
There's no way I'm bunting.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.920
Swing away?

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.800
"Just do it"? "Swing away"?
"Give it your all"?

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.840
Put all your strength into it!

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:42.380
The game depends on this!
Let's win this thing!

00:19:42.970 --> 00:19:45.510
Do whatever it takes
to find and kill whoever did this!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.720
Yes, sir!

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:49.770
I found that.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.230
It's yours, isn't it?

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:52.810
You stole it!

00:19:53.350 --> 00:19:54.940
You'll pay for that, scum!

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.690
I'm just kindly returning it to its owner.

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:03.910
Or would you rather I take it to the cops?

00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:07.490
Why did you bring it to me?

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.490
I'm betting on this too.

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:11.210
I love baseball, you see.

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.880
That is Michiru Kagemori.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.720
That is certainly an irregular
transformation she undergoes.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.340
I see now. How very interesting.

00:20:24.430 --> 00:20:26.430
<i>That closes the book on this one!</i>

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.310
<i>Killer Animals are victorious!</i>

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.940
I never thought losing
would be so heartbreaking!

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.560
Great game, Bears!

00:20:36.650 --> 00:20:39.320
<i>The fans are warmly applauding Bears.</i>

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.360
I doubt there's ever been
a game like this in Anima-City.

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.450
What a moving championship game!

00:20:44.530 --> 00:20:47.530
<i>What a great final game!</i>

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:51.620
<i>Thank you, Bears!</i>
<i>You're the slum's greatest hope!</i>

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:04.090
Here's your reward.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.720
Stick to the plan next time too.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:13.020
-Sorry, but no, thanks.
-What?

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:16.310
I'm not here to gamble.
I'm here to play baseball.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.400
I couldn't find any proof
of baseball betting.

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.200
So it will take time

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:27.410
to transform this city.

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.080
Michiru!

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:34.330
Yes?

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:37.670
With our money, we bought a machine
that will make us better at baseball!

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:39.040
Lifetime installment payments!

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:40.750
Yes!

00:21:41.210 --> 00:21:42.550
You idiots!

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.010
Take it back!

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:46.880
What? How come?

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:49.300
I hope she's having fun.

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:50.490
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
